<title>LATVIA: RTF,VALMIERA,RAUGS GAIN ON MIXED MARKET.</title>
<headline>RTF,VALMIERA,RAUGS GAIN ON MIXED MARKET.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Latvian shares registered the</p>
<p>following prices after the morning trade session on Monday.</p>
<p>Stocks were mixed while the Riga Transport Fleet, Riga</p>
<p>Shipyard maintained last week's rise.</p>
<p>RTF was up to 1.24 lats from 1.23 lats and the Riga</p>
<p>Shipyard also edged up one santime to 1.32 lats.</p>
<p>Valmiera Glassfibre on the secondary list rose to 1.40</p>
<p>lats, adding four santimes and Rigas Raugs added two santimes</p>
<p>to 3.83 lats.</p>
